{"1852980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ItLivesInTheWoods", "steam_appid": 1852980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NOTE:</strong></u><strong> </strong><i>The game focuses on exploration and builds tension slowly to create a deeper and more meaningful experience. Its story is unveiled through surreal cinematic imaging. Estimated completion time: 1.5hours. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please do leave a review if you liked the game as it helps a lot!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How far will you go to reunite with your lost daughter?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>ItLivesInTheWoods is a first-person psychological horror game set in Canada in modern times.  </i><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plot</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will experience a linear story that has multiple endings, with mystery and twists.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything was well before your daughter, Sarah, mysteriously disappeared in the forest during a hiking trip a month ago. You don't know what happened to your daughter or if she is still alive. You only know you want her back safely in your arms again.  </i><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/9322ee0b006229dab81c070c1e712481.poster.avif?t=1785097631\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/9322ee0b006229dab81c070c1e712481.webm?t=1785097631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/9322ee0b006229dab81c070c1e712481.mp4?t=1785097631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The deeper you go into the forest, the more you will question what is real and what is not. </i><br><br><br><br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is developed with a sense of hyper-realism to create a visually stunning and memorable experience powered by Unreal Engine 5.</i> <br> <br><i>You will explore a rich procedurally generated forest where the more you explore, the more you will unearth the reality of your daughter. However, in doing so will also introduce you to certain evil, of which you must overcome to reunite with your daughter. Some things you encounter will seem surreal, and may actually be so.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Can you trust your eyes?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/4318d87d816b39d452e56ff578783095.poster.avif?t=1785097631\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/4318d87d816b39d452e56ff578783095.webm?t=1785097631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/4318d87d816b39d452e56ff578783095.mp4?t=1785097631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will uncover minor puzzles and cues of which you must complete to understand your surroundings and progress in the game. Objects in the game are inspectable and/or interactable, where some will enrich the story with new information or backstory, and some will simulate the environment for realism.    </i>   <br> <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perhaps you will be face-to-face with an evil which will test your survival skills until either you are defeated or it.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/a9d65b8eec397bc425b3b9ae5233de5a.poster.avif?t=1785097631\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/a9d65b8eec397bc425b3b9ae5233de5a.webm?t=1785097631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852980/extras/a9d65b8eec397bc425b3b9ae5233de5a.mp4?t=1785097631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NOTE:</strong></u><strong> </strong><i>The game focuses on exploration and builds tension slowly to create a deeper and more meaningful experience. Its story is unveiled through surreal cinematic imaging. Estimated completion time: 1.5hours. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please do leave a review if you liked the game as it helps a lot!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How far will you go to reunite with your lost daughter?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>ItLivesInTheWoods is a first-person psychological horror game set in Canada in modern times.  </i><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plot</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will experience a linear story that has multiple endings, with mystery and twists.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything was well before your daughter, Sarah, mysteriously disappeared in the forest during a hiking trip a month ago. You don't know what happened to your daughter or if she is still alive. You only know you want her back safely in your arms again.